
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
newton          on

variable        a0           equal 3.59
variable        nrep         equal 10
variable        seed         equal 492845
variable        delta        equal 0.005
variable        etol         equal 1.0e-12
variable        ftol         equal 1.0e-10
variable        maxiter      equal 10000
variable        maxeval      equal 100000

# ------------ SYSTEM / STRUCTURE ------------
lattice        fcc ${a0}
lattice        fcc 3.59
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.59 3.59 3.59
region         box block 0 ${nrep} 0 ${nrep} 0 ${nrep}
region         box block 0 10 0 ${nrep} 0 ${nrep}
region         box block 0 10 0 10 0 ${nrep}
region         box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box     5 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (35.9 35.9 35.9)
  2 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
create_atoms   1 box
Created 4000 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (35.9 35.9 35.9)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds

# Example random equiatomic assignment across 5 types (1..5)
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.20 ${seed}
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.20 492845
Setting atom values ...
  811 settings made for type/fraction
set type 1 type/fraction 3 0.25 ${seed}
set type 1 type/fraction 3 0.25 492845
Setting atom values ...
  197 settings made for type/fraction
set type 1 type/fraction 4 0.3333 ${seed}
set type 1 type/fraction 4 0.3333 492845
Setting atom values ...
  326 settings made for type/fraction
set type 1 type/fraction 5 0.5 ${seed}
set type 1 type/fraction 5 0.5 492845
Setting atom values ...
  681 settings made for type/fraction

# Masses
mass 1 58.933   # Co
mass 2 58.69    # Ni
mass 3 51.96    # Cr
mass 4 55.847   # Fe
mass 5 54.94    # Mn

# ---- Potential: 2018 Choi et al. Co-Ni-Cr-Fe-Mn MEAM ----
# Files expected in current directory: ./library.meam and ./CoNiCrFeMn.meam
pair_style meam
pair_coeff * * ./library.meam Co Ni Cr Fe Mn ./CoNiCrFeMn.meam Co Ni Cr Fe Mn

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes

# ------------ MINIMIZATION TO 0 K ------------
reset_timestep  0
thermo          100
thermo_style    custom step pe lx ly lz pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz

min_style       cg
min_modify      dmax 0.1 line quadratic
minimize        ${etol} ${ftol} ${maxiter} ${maxeval}
minimize        1e-12 ${ftol} ${maxiter} ${maxeval}
minimize        1e-12 1e-10 ${maxiter} ${maxeval}
minimize        1e-12 1e-10 10000 ${maxeval}
minimize        1e-12 1e-10 10000 100000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 6.5
  ghost atom cutoff = 6.5
  binsize = 3.25, bins = 12 12 12
  2 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 2 0 0
  (1) pair meam, perpetual
      attributes: full, newton on
      pair build: full/bin/atomonly
      stencil: full/bin/3d
      bin: standard
  (2) pair meam, perpetual, half/full from (1)
      attributes: half, newton on
      pair build: halffull/newton
      stencil: none
      bin: none
Per MPI rank memory allocation (min/avg/max) = 10.69 | 10.69 | 10.69 Mbytes
   Step         PotEng           Lx             Ly             Lz            Pxx            Pyy            Pzz            Pxy            Pxz            Pyz      
         0  -16724.383      35.9           35.9           35.9          -43825.612     -43761.5       -43528.209      69.925473     -30.164196      47.302403    
        77  -16739.9        35.9           35.9           35.9          -42493.121     -42447.674     -42186.728      93.605048     -12.129256      66.129192    
